# No left accent border design

Never use thick colored left-edge accent bars on cards, metric tiles, or panels (e.g. `border-l-4 border-l-primary`, `border-l-sky-500` as a card accent stripe).

Prefer uniform borders (`border border-border`), soft background tints, or illustrations for differentiation instead.
